Description: Keeps the subjects, samples, and analysis outputs of a study in
    one validated object. Species and assay are values in the data, not fixed
    types, so the same model fits any organism and any omics assay. A
    long-format sample manifest is read and validated, tumor and normal pairs
    are derived on demand, a pipeline sample sheet is written from the same
    object, and analysis outputs are registered and loaded by path template.
    Manual fixes are kept in an audit trail, and features can be translated
    across species through pluggable liftover and ortholog backends.
